<title>JAPAN: Feb Nikkei options settled at 18,774.71 -- brokers.</title>
<headline>Feb Nikkei options settled at 18,774.71 -- brokers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers estimated that Nikkei options contracts for February were settled at 18,774.71 on Friday.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange will announce official data on the options settlement after the market closes today at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
<p>The February options expired after Thursday&quot;s close.</p>
